{
  "description": "MerLin photonic ADAPTATION, corrected after independent review 2: as table1_merlin plus a fixed 50:50 beam-splitter brickwork before the first data layer, so all 4 re-uploading layers act (in table1_merlin the layer-0 encoding has no effect). Authors' MKL protocol; pairs with S5 and M1.",
